2],{"class":753},"Read-only access for the diagnostics window.",[252,924,745],{"class":732},[252,926,759],{"class":732},[252,928,929,931,933,935,937,939,941,944,946],{"class":254,"line":279},[252,930,738],{"class":732},[252,932,806],{"class":741},[252,934,745],{"class":732},[252,936,720],{"class":732},[252,938,813],{"class":732},[252,940,745],{"class":732},[252,942,943],{"class":753},"diagnostics",[252,945,745],{"class":732},[252,947,823],{"class":732},[252,949,950,952,954,956,958],{"class":254,"line":285},[252,951,738],{"class":732},[252,953,830],{"class":741},[252,955,745],{"class":732},[252,957,720],{"class":732},[252,959,837],{"class":732},[252,961,962,964,966,968],{"class":254,"line":291},[252,963,842],{"class":732},[252,965,440],{"class":753},[252,967,745],{"class":732},[252,969,759],{"class":732},[252,971,972,974,976,978],{"class":254,"line":297},[252,973,842],{"class":732},[252,975,463],{"class":753},[252,977,745],{"class":732},[252,979,759],{"class":732},[252,981,982,984,986],{"class":254,"line":303},[252,983,842],{"class":732},[252,985,693],{"class":753},[252,987,848],{"class":732},[252,989,990],{"class":254,"line":309},[252,991,853],{"class":732},[252,993,994],{"class":254,"line":315},[252,995,858],{"class":732},[362,997,999],{"id":998},"practical-guidance","Practical guidance",[223,1001,1002,1003,1006,1007,1010,1011,1014],{},"Use the default permission set for a local-first app that exposes all model operations. For a narrower UI, grant only the commands the window needs. For example, a read-only diagnostics view may need ",[227,1004,1005],{},"allow-list-models"," and ",[227,1008,1009],{},"allow-retrieve-model"," (plus ",[227,1012,1013],{},"allow-cancel"," for in-flight requests) but not the load, generate or embed commands.",[223,1016,1017,1018,1021,1022,1024,1025,1027,1028,1031,1032,1035,1036,1038],{},"Streaming chat requires both ",[227,1019,1020],{},"allow-stream-chat-completion"," (to start the stream) and ",[227,1023,1013],{}," (to abort it). The client cancels through ",[227,1026,698],{}," when the consumer drops the ",[227,1029,1030],{},"AsyncIterable"," early or aborts the ",[227,1033,1034],{},"AbortSignal",", so always include ",[227,1037,1013],{}," in any capability that may invoke a streaming command.",[223,1040,1041],{},"Remember that permissions gate IPC access. They do not validate model paths, model provenance, prompt size, or resource usage. Apply those rules in your application layer.",[1043,1044,1045],"style",{},"html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}html.dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNy